	# Prior to the change,the script irmGetAcctNumFromIBAN.scr was a sample script and
	# the existence of the script was used as a parameter to determine if
	# the account given should be a IBAN number or a foracid. After the fix
	# for 323890 the IBAN Validation flag at HPAYSYS level will be used
